  << /ActualText (Although this was originally a friendship bracelet pattern\054 it translated perfectly to bead weaving like no other\056 I made minimal adjustments\054 and my wife picked out the bead colors\056 We\047re happy to share the updates\072\nNarrowed to 13 beads to fit a standard clasp tube\056\nAdded side rows to space ghosts away from the clasps\056\nStretched vertically by 1\0562x to adjust for the bead aspect ratio\056\nThree length options\072 conventionally men\047s\054 women\047s\054 and kids\047 sizes\056\nGeneral permission for posting this kind of modifications\072      )
